Package: golemenviro
Title: Real-Time Visualization of Pimoroni Enviro Sensor Data from Prometheus
Description: A 'shiny' application, built as a 'golem' package, that displays
    the readings of Pimoroni Enviro and Enviro+ sensors exported to
    'Prometheus': gauges with the latest readings, and a time series chart
    per sensor.
